{"reviews":[{"id":"B08NFJ2GGT-0","r":5.0,"t":"Nopunzel Hair Inhibitor does work !!!","x":"I was skeptical about permanent hair removal product as  i tried few in past. But  after trying Nopunzel , I see the positive result and show density went down. I order more and  after using over 20+ times, I see 80% are gone from my underarm.  And there was no reaction or burning sensation for my skin.  Smell is also good. I am very happy with the product.","h":23,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B08NFJ2GGT-1","r":5.0,"t":"Easy to use","x":"This product arrived 3 days ago. I used it right away as I have coarse chin hairs that I would like to inhibit.  I like that it has no smell and reacts well to my very sensitive skin. The directions are also very clear and it\u2019s easy to use the compact spray bottle.","h":20,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B08NFJ2GGT-2","r":5.0,"t":"So far so good","x":"Been using for about 4 days noticed a difference already. Can\u2019t wait to see results in few weeks. Wish it was thicker it\u2019s water consistency and could be in a bigger bottle.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08NFJ2GGT-3","r":1.0,"t":"Bottle is too small","x":"The bottle is WAY to small if you want to use it on your legs and any other place. Could be good for small areas of hair removal but i wasn\u2019t able to see if it worked because the bottle only lasted me a week.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08NFJ2GGT-4","r":5.0,"t":"This Hair Inhibitor works Great!!!","x":"I\u2019ve been using this product for 15 days and I\u2019m already seeing a difference. Best product on the market and value-priced. Slows down the growth of the hair. And the scent is LOVELY:)","h":4,"v":0,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B08NFJ2GGT-5","r":5.0,"t":"So far so good!!","x":"Smells good and the application doesn't burn. Been using daily for a week and feel like there's a difference already. Cannot wait to see the results in 4-6 wks.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B08NFJ2GGT-6","r":5.0,"t":"Great","x":"Works great, also doesn\u2019t have a bad smell. Actually has a nice smell when using it. Very happy with it","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08NFJ2GGT-7","r":5.0,"t":"Good product!","x":"This is easy to use and it\u2019s a good thing because it doesn\u2019t come with many directions. Just point and spray. The picture with the pen is a size reference. Two sprays does a lot though, so it should last. I\u2019ve used it for about a week and there is no negative effects or coloring. It seems to be helping reduce the growth rate.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08NFJ2GGT-8","r":5.0,"t":"Content with the purchase.","x":"The package is smaller than I expected but I\u2019m hoping that means you don\u2019t need to use as much. I love that there is no harsh smell & it doesn\u2019t irritate my sensitive skin. The liquid sprays out a little too concentrated so I put it on a cotton pad & wipe my skin. So far I like it, hoping it works quickly!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08NFJ2GGT-9","r":5.0,"t":"A great choice","x":"I was hesitant about it when I bought it for the first time, didn't think it was going to work. Then a month went by, as it says to in the directions after using it once a day... and I saw the results. I'm actually surprised and amazed! I am happy with this product, happy enough to buy another!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08NFJ2GGT-10","r":1.0,"t":"Don\u2019t waist your money","x":"Espere unos cuantos d\u00edas antes de escribir la rese\u00f1a Y no funciona en lo absoluto, no se ve ninguna diferencia, las tiras para depilar son de muy mala calidad, se quedan partes impregnadas en la piel  Pens\u00e9 que como este producto, relativamente econ\u00f3mico pod\u00eda ser tan bueno en cuanto a las rese\u00f1as y he aqu\u00ed la respuesta  Te ofrecen una gift card de $15 por tu review, tal vez por eso tantas personas lo recomiendan","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08NFJ2GGT-11","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect and easy to use","x":"It didn\u2019t take long at all for me to notice a difference in my hair growth. It works wonderfully. It\u2019s very easy to use, just a quick spray, and the scent is pleasant. Most importantly, it doesn\u2019t irritate my sensitive skin. Very happy with this!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08NFJ2GGT-12","r":5.0,"t":"Smooth as a hairless baby","x":"I have Pcos and this product has already made a difference in two days no stubble my chin is nice and smooth. I wish I would have found this product years ago! Buy it ladies you won\u2019t regret it!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08NFJ2GGT-13","r":1.0,"t":"2 weeks in and NO RESULT","x":"So far I have been using it for more than 2 weeks and NO RESULT! I will keep using it for the 4 weeks to see what happens.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08NFJ2GGT-14","r":5.0,"t":"slows hair growth but idk about stopping growth (yet)","x":"It's a very small spray bottle. I used my fingers to rub the product in. I used a Neomen Hair Remover to remove the hair and then sprayed this on after use. It says 5-6 weeks for results but I noticed my hair didn't grow back as fast after use. I've used this after each time I've removed hair from my body and the hair growth has slowed significantly. It used to grow back by the next day but, with this product, it's taken 4-5 days to show even slight growth. I use this on my upper lip, thighs, fo","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08NFJ2GGT-15","r":5.0,"t":"This actually works but pluck or wax first","x":"This product actually works.  I was really skeptical at first.  In fact, when I first tried it, it didn't work at all even though I applied it every day.  But turns out that was because I was using a depilatory cream.  That only removes the hair up to the surface, similar to shaving.  Then I read in one of the comments or Q&A that you need to pluck or wax first so that the product can get into the follicle.  So I tried that instead.  And it worked!  Normally my hair starts growing back within 2 ","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08NFJ2GGT-16","r":5.0,"t":"it's easy to use","x":"this bottle came yesterday . I used it right away as I have coarse chin hairs . I like that it has no smell . The directions are also very clear and it\u2019s easy to use the compact spray bottle. I could see results already with in a week","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08NFJ2GGT-17","r":2.0,"t":"Reaction!","x":"Honestly I couldn\u2019t keep using this product to see if it would work because it gave me terrible acne! I don\u2019t have acne normally and this made me have acne all over the part of skin that I sprayed.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08NFJ2GGT-18","r":5.0,"t":"This thing really works","x":"I have use this product for sometime now and it slows the hair grow. If you think using this product will not grow hair then it in not for you. This product will only slow down the hair grow.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B08NFJ2GGT-19","r":5.0,"t":"Wow it is working!","x":"I have already used this a few times & the hair on my arms is not coming back as thick. I am very hairy....lol & look forward to trying this on my more sensitive areas next! :)","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08NFJ2GGT-20","r":5.0,"t":"Works Very well","x":"This works very well both me and my husband use it . He does not have to shave as much .. and I don't have to shave as much either. I will be buying this more often.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08NFJ2GGT-21","r":1.0,"t":"Useless","x":"I bought two 50 ml bottles. Used it on my face for more than three months and didn\u2019t see any result. Absolutely waste of money. Wouldn\u2019t recommend","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B08NFJ2GGT-22","r":5.0,"t":"Easy to apply!","x":"Great applicator. The mist is fine and feels good on my face. Happy with my purchase.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08NFJ2GGT-23","r":1.0,"t":"No es bueno","x":"Muy mala reputaci\u00f3n no es nada de lo que dicen en el anuncio no funciona es falso","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08NFJ2GGT-24","r":3.0,"t":"If it slows hair growth?","x":"It really doesn\u2019t slow down hair growth.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers report seeing reduced or slower hair growth after regular use, often within days to a few weeks.","cites":[1,3,5,6,10,12,13,15]},{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the product for being easy to use with a simple spray application.","cites":[2,8,9,12]},{"text":"Several reviewers note the product has a pleasant or mild scent and does not irritate sensitive skin.","cites":[2,6,7,9,12]},{"text":"A common complaint is that the bottle is too small, especially for larger areas like legs.","cites":[3,4,9,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers report no visible results even after one to two weeks of use.","cites":[11,14]}]},"qa":[]}